#. Description of the plugin
#: social-relay-for-postiz.php:5
msgid "Auto-publish and schedule your WordPress content on social networks through your own Postiz instance (self-hosted or Postiz Cloud)."
msgstr "Publica y programa automáticamente tu contenido de WordPress en redes sociales a través de tu propia instancia de Postiz (autoalojada o Postiz Cloud)."

